{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_vrtx_01U8wzh3KK7Q8cBM63HiGf8h","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Done. Wrote **Q24: Where do embeddings fail?** (`02-024-where-do-embeddings-fail-negation-temporal-reasoning-precisi.md`).\n\nThe note covers:\n- **3 failure modes with root causes:** negation (contrastive training ignores polarity → cosine > 0.85 between \"X\" and \"not X\"), exact-match precision (BPE fragments SKUs/codes/legal citations), temporal reasoning (no time axis in embedding space, 2022 vs 2024 policy docs look identical)\n- **4th mode: conjunctive/multi-hop queries** — single vector can't enforce multiple simultaneous conditions\n- **Concrete production incident:** SKU-code recall@5 31% → 78% with BM25+dense hybrid RRF\n- **Targeted mitigations:** hybrid BM25+dense (Elasticsearch 8.9 RRF), metadata date/sku filters at retrieval, cross-encoder reranking for polarity fixes\n- **3 pitfalls** including the common trap of proposing \"fine-tune the embedder\" as a fix for negation (it doesn't work at the architectural level)"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":396,"cache_read_input_tokens":60252,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":396,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ccc9aa42-3843-4ab3-bbab-2c733eacca15","uuid":"74f1cb31-be3f-41ed-a062-178937375baf"}
